---
---

<section id="projetos" aria-label="Projetos selecionados">
  <!-- Editorial Lead-In Header (Enki .services-top-grid pattern) -->
  <div class="container-ed grid-12 items-end pt-[clamp(96px,13vh,170px)] pb-[clamp(48px,7vh,96px)] border-t border-[var(--line)]">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-3">
      <p class="p-ed text-[#ff5500]">01 / Portfólio selecionado</p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5 h2-ed">
      Trabalhos que <span class="serif-italic font-normal text-[var(--grey)]">falam</span> por si.
    </h2>
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 max-w-[360px]">
      <p class="p-ed">
        Antes de falar sobre metodologia ou preços, veja sistemas e páginas reais construídos sob medida para gerar autoridade, velocidade e resultado operacional.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Sticky Stacking Slides Stage (Enki .slides + Diogo .browser-window) -->
  <div class="slides-stage">
    <!-- SLIDE 01: CSF Steel Frame -->
    <article class="project-slide" data-slide-index="0">
      <div class="project-slide-inner bg-[#111111] text-[#faf8f5]">
        <div class="container-ed h-full flex flex-col justify-between py-[var(--gutter)]">
          <!-- Slide Header -->
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-6 pt-6 md:pt-10">
            <h3 class="text-[clamp(40px,7.2vw,112px)] font-medium leading-[0.86] tracking-[-0.055em]">
              CSF Steel Frame<br />
              <span class="serif-italic font-normal text-[var(--grey)]">&amp; Chalés.</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[clamp(44px,8vw,120px)] font-medium leading-[0.85] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[rgba(250,248,245,0.22)]">
              01
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Slide Body (12-Column Editorial + Browser Window) -->
          <div class="grid-12 items-start pt-6 border-t border-[var(--line)]">
            <!-- Col 1-2: Niche & Metrics -->
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Setor</p>
                <p class="p-ed">Construção a Seco &amp; Indústria</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Performance</p>
                <p class="p-ed text-[#ff5500]">0.6s LCP · 100 CWV</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Arquitetura</p>
                <p class="p-ed">Astro · Tailwind CSS</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Col 3-6: Narrative & CTA -->
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-3 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
              <div class="space-y-4 max-w-[400px]">
                <p class="p-ed white">
                  Catálogo técnico de perfis estruturais e vitrine imersiva de chalés modulares projetados para captação comercial imediata.
                </p>
                <p class="p-ed">
                  Substituiu a navegação lenta por páginas estáticas pré-renderizadas que abrem instantaneamente no 4G de engenheiros e compradores, conectando cada produto direto ao WhatsApp da equipe de vendas.
                </p>
              </div>

              <a
                href="https://wa.me/5535984788359?text=Ol%C3%A1%20Gustavo!%20Vi%20o%20projeto%20da%20CSF%20Steel%20Frame%20e%20quero%20um%20site%20nesse%20padr%C3%A3o."
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="line-link"
              >
                <span class="roll">
                  <span class="roll-a">Quero um projeto nesse padrão</span>
                  <span class="roll-b" aria-hidden="true">Quero um projeto nesse padrão</span>
                </span>
                <span class="text-[#ff5500]">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Col 7-13: Diogo-style Browser Frame Preview -->
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
              <div class="browser-window group">
                <div class="browser-chrome">
                  <div class="browser-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                  <span class="browser-url">csfsteelframe.com.br</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-[#ff5500]">ONLINE</span>
                </div>
                <div class="aspect-[16/9] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[radial-gradient(90%_90%_at_85%_15%,rgba(255,85,0,0.22),transparent_65%),linear-gradient(145deg,#171513_0%,#0c0c0d_100%)] relative overflow-hidden">
                  <!-- Architectural wireframe grid lines inside mockup -->
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[rgba(250,248,245,0.1)] pb-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#ff5500]"></span>
                      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#faf8f5]">CSF STEEL FRAME</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex gap-4 text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)]">
                      <span>Perfis Drywall</span>
                      <span>Chalés</span>
                      <span>Isolamento</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-end my-auto py-2">
                    <div class="col-span-7 space-y-2">
                      <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#ff5500]">Engenharia Estrutural</span>
                      <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium text-[#faf8f5] leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]">
                        Construção seca de alta precisão.
                      </div>
                      <p class="text-[11px] text-[var(--grey)] leading-snug">
                        Perfis galvanizados NBR 15253 e kits completos para obras rápidas.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-5 border border-[rgba(255,85,0,0.3)] bg-[#141312] p-3 space-y-2">
                      <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-[var(--dim)]">
                        <span>CHALÉ ALPINO M1</span>
                        <span class="text-[#ff5500]">48m²</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="h-12 border border-[var(--line)] bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,85,0,0.15),transparent)] flex items-end p-1.5">
                        <span class="text-[9px] text-[#faf8f5]">Estrutura 100% Steel Frame</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(250,248,245,0.1)] text-[11px]">
                    <span class="text-[var(--dim)]">Catálogo interativo + Orçamento WhatsApp</span>
                    <span class="text-[#faf8f5] font-medium">LCP: 580ms</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-slide-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- SLIDE 02: Aurora Bookstore -->
    <article class="project-slide" data-slide-index="1">
      <div class="project-slide-inner bg-[#161514] text-[#faf8f5]">
        <div class="container-ed h-full flex flex-col justify-between py-[var(--gutter)]">
          <!-- Slide Header -->
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-6 pt-6 md:pt-10">
            <h3 class="text-[clamp(40px,7.2vw,112px)] font-medium leading-[0.86] tracking-[-0.055em]">
              Aurora<br />
              <span class="serif-italic font-normal text-[var(--grey)]">Bookstore.</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[clamp(44px,8vw,120px)] font-medium leading-[0.85] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[rgba(250,248,245,0.22)]">
              02
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Slide Body -->
          <div class="grid-12 items-start pt-6 border-t border-[var(--line)]">
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Setor</p>
                <p class="p-ed">E-Commerce &amp; Plataforma Digital</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Recursos</p>
                <p class="p-ed text-[#ff5500]">Auth · Busca · Checkout</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Arquitetura</p>
                <p class="p-ed">React · TypeScript · API REST</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-3 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
              <div class="space-y-4 max-w-[400px]">
                <p class="p-ed white">
                  Ecossistema completo de livraria digital com curadoria editorial, busca instantânea e gestão transacional de pedidos.
                </p>
                <p class="p-ed">
                  Desenvolvido com foco em experiência de leitura, autenticação segura de clientes, recuperação de estado de carrinho e painel administrativo para controle de estoque em tempo real.
                </p>
              </div>

              <a
                href="https://wa.me/5535984788359?text=Ol%C3%A1%20Gustavo!%20Vi%20a%20plataforma%20Aurora%20Bookstore%20e%20gostaria%20de%20or%C3%A7ar%20um%20sistema%20web."
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="line-link"
              >
                <span class="roll">
                  <span class="roll-a">Consultar sistema semelhante</span>
                  <span class="roll-b" aria-hidden="true">Consultar sistema semelhante</span>
                </span>
                <span class="text-[#ff5500]">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
              <div class="browser-window">
                <div class="browser-chrome">
                  <div class="browser-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                  <span class="browser-url">aurorabookstore.app</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-[#ff5500]">FULL-STACK</span>
                </div>
                <div class="aspect-[16/9] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[radial-gradient(80%_80%_at_20%_20%,rgba(255,85,0,0.16),transparent_65%),linear-gradient(155deg,#181615_0%,#0b0b0c_100%)]">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[rgba(250,248,245,0.1)] pb-3">
                    <span class="serif-italic text-lg text-[#faf8f5]">Aurora Editorial</span>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)]">
                      <span>Acervo (2.4k)</span>
                      <span class="px-2 py-0.5 border border-[var(--line)] text-[#faf8f5]">Carrinho (2)</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 my-auto py-2">
                    <div class="border border-[var(--line)] bg-[#111112] p-3 space-y-1.5">
                      <div class="text-[9px] text-[#ff5500]">ARQUITETURA</div>
                      <div class="text-xs font-medium text-[#faf8f5]">The Elements of Style</div>
                      <div class="text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)]">R$ 84,00</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border border-[rgba(255,85,0,0.4)] bg-[#151312] p-3 space-y-1.5">
                      <div class="text-[9px] text-[#ff5500]">DESTAQUE</div>
                      <div class="text-xs font-medium text-[#faf8f5]">Sistemas Distribuídos</div>
                      <div class="text-[11px] text-[#faf8f5]">R$ 129,00</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border border-[var(--line)] bg-[#111112] p-3 space-y-1.5">
                      <div class="text-[9px] text-[var(--dim)]">DESIGN</div>
                      <div class="text-xs font-medium text-[#faf8f5]">Grid Systems</div>
                      <div class="text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)]">R$ 160,00</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(250,248,245,0.1)] text-[11px]">
                    <span class="text-[var(--dim)]">Catálogo reativo + OAuth 2.0 + Painel Admin</span>
                    <span class="text-[#ff5500]">99.9% Uptime</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-slide-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- SLIDE 03: SisAPEC Healthcare -->
    <article class="project-slide" data-slide-index="2">
      <div class="project-slide-inner bg-[#1c1917] text-[#faf8f5]">
        <div class="container-ed h-full flex flex-col justify-between py-[var(--gutter)]">
          <!-- Slide Header -->
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-6 pt-6 md:pt-10">
            <h3 class="text-[clamp(40px,7.2vw,112px)] font-medium leading-[0.86] tracking-[-0.055em]">
              SisAPEC<br />
              <span class="serif-italic font-normal text-[var(--grey)]">Healthcare.</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[clamp(44px,8vw,120px)] font-medium leading-[0.85] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[rgba(250,248,245,0.22)]">
              03
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Slide Body -->
          <div class="grid-12 items-start pt-6 border-t border-[var(--line)]">
            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Setor</p>
                <p class="p-ed">Saúde Pública &amp; Telemetria</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Escala Real</p>
                <p class="p-ed text-[#ff5500]">80.000+ Pacientes</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="p-ed white">Padrão</p>
                <p class="p-ed">HL7 FHIR · Java · Wearables</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-3 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
              <div class="space-y-4 max-w-[400px]">
                <p class="p-ed white">
                  Módulos clínicos de prontuário eletrônico e ingestão de sinais vitais via smartwatches operando em ambiente crítico de saúde.
                </p>
                <p class="p-ed">
                  Interoperabilidade estruturada no padrão internacional HL7 FHIR para captura contínua de frequência cardíaca, SpO2 e anamnese clínica, comprovando maturidade de engenharia para sistemas de alta responsabilidade.
                </p>
              </div>

              <a
                href="https://wa.me/5535984788359?text=Ol%C3%A1%20Gustavo!%20Vi%20sua%20experi%C3%AAncia%20no%20SisAPEC%20e%20quero%20discutir%20um%20sistema%20sob%20medida."
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="line-link"
              >
                <span class="roll">
                  <span class="roll-a">Discutir engenharia sob medida</span>
                  <span class="roll-b" aria-hidden="true">Discutir engenharia sob medida</span>
                </span>
                <span class="text-[#ff5500]">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
              <div class="browser-window">
                <div class="browser-chrome">
                  <div class="browser-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                  <span class="browser-url">sisapec.health / fhir-telemetry</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-[#ff5500]">HL7 FHIR R4</span>
                </div>
                <div class="aspect-[16/9] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-[radial-gradient(85%_85%_at_75%_20%,rgba(255,85,0,0.2),transparent_65%),linear-gradient(155deg,#191614_0%,#0a0a0b_100%)]">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[rgba(250,248,245,0.1)] pb-3">
                    <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#faf8f5]">Telemetria Clínica &amp; Anamnese</span>
                    <span class="text-[11px] text-[#ff5500]">80k+ Prontuários Ativos</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 my-auto py-2">
                    <div class="border border-[var(--line)] bg-[#121110] p-3">
                      <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--dim)]">FREQUÊNCIA CARDÍACA</div>
                      <div class="text-xl font-medium text-[#faf8f5] mt-1">74 <span class="text-xs text-[#ff5500]">bpm</span></div>
                      <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--dim)] mt-1">Galaxy Watch · Sync OK</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border border-[var(--line)] bg-[#121110] p-3">
                      <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--dim)]">SATURAÇÃO SpO2</div>
                      <div class="text-xl font-medium text-[#faf8f5] mt-1">98 <span class="text-xs text-[#ff5500]">%</span></div>
                      <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--dim)] mt-1">Observation FHIR</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border border-[var(--line)] bg-[#121110] p-3">
                      <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--dim)]">LATÊNCIA INGESTÃO</div>
                      <div class="text-xl font-medium text-[#ff5500] mt-1">&lt; 180ms</div>
                      <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--dim)] mt-1">Integridade Verificada</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(250,248,245,0.1)] text-[11px]">
                    <span class="text-[var(--dim)]">Arquitetura tolerante a falhas · Conformidade LGPD</span>
                    <span class="text-[#faf8f5]">Produção</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-slide-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
